    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our can meet some of the client's requirements. our technical expertise includes API integration, Cloud architecture, and Cybersecurity, which are essential for integrating with existing systems of information and providing secure API interfaces. our have experience with cloud providers such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), all of which are within the EU and can help avoid dependency on non-European suppliers. our containerisation capabilities using Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), and Helm can facilitate deployment and management of the solution on a SecNumCloud-type infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding response time and availability, our performance benchmarks indicate that our can achieve a p95 response time of 1800 ms, which is close to but not lower than the required 2 seconds." ;
