        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, you propose an architecture that leverages our AI/ML expertise, particularly in natural language processing and machine learning, to develop an intelligent assistance tool. our can utilize our experience with LLM models such as Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3, CamemBERT, and Falcon, and fine-tuning methods like LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tune to adapt the model to the client's specific needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
