        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Are we compliant with GDPR regulations, including data hosting exclusively within the EU, and what measures do we need to take to ensure compliance? we are generally compliant with The client GDPR regulatory requirements. we standard data residency is within the EU, which aligns with The client demand for data hosting exclusively within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have experience with anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio and custom NER models, which can be used to protect personal data if necessary. we also have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed, and we contact information is dpo@nexus-engineering.it, indicating that we take data protection seriously. we cross-border transfer policy is prohibited by default unless there's an explicit legal basis, which should reassure the client regarding data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further ensure compliance, we should review we existing measures to guarantee a high level of security. review includes leveraging we ISO 27001 certification, which covers the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems. we must also ensure that we access control standards, network security architecture, and incident response plan are all aligned with the client's expectations for a high level of security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I do not have specific information on how to implement additional measures or adjust we current setup to perfectly match the client's demands without potentially compromising we existing security and compliance posture." ;
